to play an advanced game of cat and mouse on the high seas, to seize the initiative and attack with the advantage of surprise on your side. And at all times, you have to observe rules of engagement and take care not to cause an unnecessary incident that could lead to escalation. After all, you cannot really be sure just who that radar contact at 30.000 feet is, can you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286220/extras/3b68cdf16bd781acc414600b07bf7e34.poster.avif?t=1773348754\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286220/extras/3b68cdf16bd781acc414600b07bf7e34.webm?t=1773348754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1286220/extras/3b68cdf16bd781acc414600b07bf7e34.mp4?t=1773348754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0Gameplay focused on the Cold War era between the 1960s and 1980s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Over 200 naval units, including original ships and submarines, and more than 100 aircraft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Full-featured Mission Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Global map available for Mission Editor; create scenarios in any region on Earth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Rich variety of historical and fictional single scenarios, for all factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Linear Campaign (non Dynamic) with branching options and story events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Dynamic Campaign - theater scale (beta version launching mid 2026)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Pausable real-time controls with time compression op